OL,3,GNEWSAMore tea? How Scotland's crops of
OL,4,Athe future could be set to change
OL,5,
OL,6,FSusie Walker-Munro is one of a handful
OL,7,Fof tea growers in Scotland.
OL,9,FShe says the acidic soil creates ideal
OL,10,Fconditions for the perfect artisan
OL,11,Fbrew.
OL,13,FCosting about #40 per packet for her
OL,14,Fmost expensive product, it's not going
OL,15,Fto replace the supermarket brands any
OL,16,Ftime soon.
OL,18,FDroughts, intensive downpours and
OL,19,Fdiseases have created challenges for
OL,20,Ftea growers across the world as they
OL,21,Fdeal with the impact of a warming
OL,22,Fplanet.
